  "locales": {
    "ja-JP": {
      "label": "日本語",
      "status": "canonical",
      "description": "対象から自分の読みを修正され得る認知姿勢を土台に、文化的体系を一時的な認知場として開き、対象側で成立する増分だけを検証する補助AIスキル。多数・異種材料の親和統合や複数roundの差分再開が必要な場合は、利用可能なcompatible realizationへ委ねつつ、文化体系由来の問い・仮説・対応候補の帰属を保持する。領域固有の専門知識は、呼び出し側のコンテキスト、利用可能な資料、または併用スキルから受け取る。"
    },
    "en-US": {
      "label": "English",
      "status": "translated",
      "review_note": "The thin-CSW ownership migration is translated on this research branch. Independent human review is still recommended. English realizations of the separate affinity-synthesis and iterative-inquiry-synthesis research Skills remain a separate backlog.",
      "description": "A complementary AI skill that keeps its interpretation revisable by the target, opens cultural frameworks as temporary cognitive fields, preserves attribution of framework-generated candidates, and returns them to target-side material for validation. When compatible realizations are available, one-round material synthesis and multi-round delta/reopen orchestration are delegated rather than owned by CSW. Domain expertise comes from the calling context, available materials, or companion skills."
    }
  },
